      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dixfield%2C_Maine",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Dixfield’s landscape is shaped by Newton Brook, the Webb River, and the Androscoggin River, all draining the area.",
